  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2202.02 “Approved training program for initial certification” means a course that has been approved by the department pursuant to Env-Wq 2206.02(a).\n\nSource. #10447, INTERIM, eff 11-1-13, EXPIRED: 4-30-14\n\nNew. #10697, eff 10-18-14; ss by #12530, eff 6-1-18; ss by #13982, eff 5-24-24",
